# Email Configuration for Contact Form
# Replace with your actual Gmail credentials

EMAIL_USER=your-gmail-address@gmail.com
EMAIL_PASS=your-gmail-app-password

# Instructions:
# 1. Replace EMAIL_USER with your Gmail address
# 2. Replace EMAIL_PASS with a Gmail App Password (not your regular password)
# 3. To get an App Password:
#    - Enable 2-factor authentication on your Google account
#    - Go to: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#    - Select "Mail" for the app and "Other (Custom name)" for device
#    - Enter "TAPPS Contact Form" as the name
#    - Copy the 16-character password generated
# 4. Restart your development server after updating this file
